    "location": "html-block:72",
    "text": "Overview",
    "heading": "PowerLogic EM4800"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:73",
    "text": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:74",
    "text": "The compact PowerLogic EM4800 series multi-circuit energy meter from Schneider Electric enables reliable metering of individual tenants with a low installation cost-per-point by combining revenue-accurate electricity sub-metering with advanced communications technology.",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:75",
    "text": "It is ideal for multi-tenant or departmental metering applications within office towers, condominiums, apartment buildings, shopping centers and other multi-user environments.",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:76",
    "text": "The PowerLogic EM4800 series meters monitor up to 24 tenants with a single device. Multiple meters can be combined to support an unlimited number of suites.",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:77",
    "text": "Three meter models offer a choice of CT secondary ratings and installation options:",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:78",
    "text": "PowerLogic EM4805: 5 A, split- or solid-core CTs",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:79",
    "text": "PowerLogic EM4833: 0.333 V, split- or solid-core CTs",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:80",
    "text": "PowerLogic EM4880: 80 mA, solid-core CTs",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:81",
    "text": "The PowerLogic EM4800 is only available in USA, Canada, South Africa, Australia, Egypt and UAE.",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:82",
    "text": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:83",
    "text": "The PowerLogic EM4800 series meter is integral to tenant billing and energy management solutions that provide building owners with the following benefits:",
    "heading": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:84",
    "text": "Provide accurate energy sub-billing to tenants.",
    "heading": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:85",
    "text": "Empower tenants with information about their energy usage, allowing them to manage their total consumption while helping you reduce operational costs and offer more competitive lease rates.",
    "heading": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:86",
    "text": "Accurately allocate costs to departments or processes and identify saving opportunities by exposing wasteful energy practices.",
    "heading": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:87",
    "text": "Identify periods of high energy usage and revealing cost saving opportunities within your facilities.",
    "heading": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:88",
    "text": "Verify utility charges using accurate, revenue-grade meters to avoid being overcharged",
    "heading": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:89",
    "text": "Establish a “green” efficiency image for your building, such as qualifying for points within the LEED Green Building Rating System.",
    "heading": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:90",
    "text": "Applications"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:91",
    "text": "The PowerLogic EM4800 is ideal for multi-tenant or departmental metering applications within office towers, condominiums, apartment buildings, shopping centers and other multi-user environments.",
    "heading": "Applications"
